        failureDiagnosis='Secondary agreement and conditional recovery target human preferences and selected reversal episodes, not independent future availability. A fails primary predictive and per-set gates; coverage confidence also fails the controlled contested-color probe. No causal benefit or parameter repair is claimed.',
